<span id="S2.I1.ix1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="S2.I1.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.I1.ix1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Throughput data are collected on Google Pixel 8 Pro. Model accuracy on individual tasks is evaluated using the </span><span id="S2.I1.ix1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">lm-evaluation-harness</span><span id="S2.I1.ix1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep"><span id="S2.I1.ix1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(</span><a href="#bib.bib32" title="" class="ltx_ref">32</a><span id="S2.I1.ix1.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">)</span></cite><span id="S2.I1.ix1.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></p>
