</span>
</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></p>
</span></div>
</figure>
<div id="S5.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Model suite selection.</span> We evaluate three representative model suites: <span id="S5.SS1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Pythia</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib44" title="" class="ltx_ref">44</a>)</cite>, <span id="S5.SS1.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">SmolLM2</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib45" title="" class="ltx_ref">45</a>)</cite>, and <span id="S5.SS1.p2.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Qwen1.5</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib25" title="" class="ltx_ref">25</a>)</cite>, each offering a range of model sizes suited for affordable on-device deployment. Details are summarized in Table <a href="#S5.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ 5.1. Phase-oriented Empirical Study ‣ 5. On-Device LLM Empirical Study ‣ lm-Meter: Unveiling Runtime Inference Latency for On-Device Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S5.T7" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7. </span>Evaluation tasks for phase-oriented study.</figcaption>
<div id="S5.T7.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:40.2pt;vertical-align:-18.5pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-93.8pt,10.9pt) scale(0.6,0.6) ;">
<p id="S5.T7.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.T7.2.1.1" class="ltx_text">
<span id="S5.T7.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:532.6pt;height:62pt;vertical-align:-28.5pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(0.0pt,0.0pt) scale(1,1) ;">
<span id="S5.T7.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text">

<span id="S5.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<span class="ltx_thead">
<span id="S5.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="S5.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_ttt">Categories</span>
<span id="S5.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_ttt">Tasks</span>
<span id="S5.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r ltx_border_ttt">Full datasets</span>
<span id="S5.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_ttt">Sampled subsets</span></span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_tbody">
<span id="S5.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="S5.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_t ltx_rowspan ltx_rowspan_2"><span id="S5.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text">Knowledge ability</span></span>
<span id="S5.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">ARC-Easy <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib46" title="" class="ltx_ref">46</a>)</cite></span>
<span id="S5.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">2.38k prompts</span>
