<span id="S5.T7.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">HellaSwag <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib47" title="" class="ltx_ref">47</a>)</cite></span>
